# Google Maps Geocoding API key, used client-side by the marketplace-draft
# tab's address search (converts an address to lat/lng in the browser via
# Google's Geocoding REST API — no backend involvement, same approach as
# LocalTaskApp's web geocodingService.ts). Google's Geocoding API responds
# with Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * so this can be called directly from
# the browser.
#
# Reuse the same key as LocalTaskApp's EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY if it
# has no HTTP referrer restriction, or create a separate key restricted to
# this admin panel's domain(s).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
